  "description_text": "Welcome to 148 Russek Dr, Staten Island, NY 10312! Nestled in a quiet residential community in the desirable Huguenot neighborhood, this charming multi-level home features 3 bedrooms, 1.5 bathrooms, and a thoughtfully designed layout offering comfort and functionality. The lower level provides a spacious family room, while the home also features a built-in garage, additional parking for two vehicles, a private balcony, and a deck perfect for outdoor relaxation. Residents can also enjoy access to a community swimming pool. Conveniently located near local and express bus routes with service to Manhattan, as well as the Huguenot Staten Island Railway Station, providing connections to the St. George Ferry Terminal. Close to shopping, dining, and everyday essentials, this home offers a wonderful combination of peaceful residential living and commuter convenience!",
