  "description_text": "Welcome to this beautifully maintained 3-bedroom, 2.5-bath semi-attached home offering the perfect combination of comfort, space, and functionality. Nestled on a desirable Staten Island block, this move-in-ready residence features a bright and inviting layout designed for today's lifestyle. The main level offers a spacious living room, formal dining area, and an updated eat-in kitchen with ample cabinet and counter space, making it ideal for both everyday living and entertaining. A convenient half bath completes the first floor. The second level features a generously sized primary bedroom, two additional well-proportioned bedrooms, and a full bath. Hardwood floors, abundant natural light, and excellent storage can be found throughout the home. The fully finished basement provides valuable additional space and can be used as a family room, recreation area, home office, gym, A full bath adds convenience and flexibility to this lower level. Outside, enjoy a private backyard perfect for relaxing, gardening, or hosting gatherings. This well-cared-for home has been lovingly maintained and is ready for its next owner to move right in and enjoy. Conveniently located near shopping, restaurants, parks, schools, and transportation, this spacious semi-attached home offers everything today's buyer is looking for. Don't miss this fantastic opportunity to own a beautiful home in one of Staten Island's sought-after neighborhoods!",
